  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b><color=#FFFFFF>Game Design</color></b>\n@Briareosam, Ahmet Bu\u011Fra
    Erba\u015F\n\n<b><color=#FFFFFF>Art and Animations</color></b>\n@Briareosam,
    Ahmet Bu\u011Fra Erba\u015F\n\n<b><color=#FFFFFF>Programming</color></b>\nAhmet
    Bu\u011Fra Erba\u015F\n\n<b><color=#FFFFFF>Playtesting</color></b>\n@Briareosam,
    Metehan Durgun\n\n<b><color=#FFFFFF>Sound Effects</color></b>\nFrom Freesound.org\n\n\"Forge\"
    by Pashee (CC BY-NC 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/193352/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/193352</u></color></link>\n\n\"Metal
    hitting metal sliding\" by Nightwatcher98 (CC BY-NC 3.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/407278/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/407278</u></color></link>\n\n\"Metal
    Impact\" by 170084 (CC BY-NC 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/408188/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/408188</u></color></link>\n\n\"ClickingSound\"
    by 0001056156 (CC BY-NC 3.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/264847/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/264847</u></color></link>\n\n\"Magic
    Metal Ring Aura White Shimmer Variations\" by EminYILDIRIM (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/581627/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/581627</u></color></link>\n\n\"Holy
    Protection Skill Buff\" by EminYILDIRIM (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/621206/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/621206</u></color></link>\n\n\"Mystic
    Rune Stinger - Viking Percussion Magic\" by TommasoMotteran (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/868220/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/868220</u></color></link>\n\n\"MCU
    Corvus Glaive Inspired Sword Stab Sound\" by Artninja (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/816366/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/816366</u></color></link>\n\n\"Draw
    Sword\" by mokasza (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/810201/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/810201</u></color></link>\n\n\"SFX
    Bow & Arrow Attacks\" by PoundSoundUK (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/717823/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/717823</u></color></link>\n\n\"floppy_disk01\"
    by andre.nascimento (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/61086/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/61086</u></color></link>\n\n\"Clunking
    Large Stones Together 5\" by F.M.Audio (CC BY 4.0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/570529/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/570529</u></color></link>\n\n\"A
    Dungeon Ambience Loop\" by Grubzyy (CC0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/422720/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/422720</u></color></link>\n\n\"Wooden
    Hover\" by BenjaminNelan (CC0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/321082/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/321082</u></color></link>\n\n\"Metal
    Flick-Hit\" by Lavacoal123 (CC0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/424424/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/424424</u></color></link>\n\n\"Woosh
    6\" by mateusboga (CC0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/614089/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/614089</u></color></link>\n\n\"Arrow
    Wood Impact Single Archery 01\" by JoeDinesSound (CC0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/534956/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/534956</u></color></link>\n\n\"Stomp\"
    by boop_7 (CC0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/684375/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/684375</u></color></link>\n\n\"Metallic
    Scrape Slide\" by TheWandermiles (CC0)\n<link=\"https://freesound.org/s/673329/\"><color=#8FC7FF><u>freesound.org/s/673329</u></color></link>\n\nSome
    sounds were edited for use in this game.\n\n<b><color=#FFFFFF>Third-party</color></b>\nDOTween
    - Demigiant\nSitka Small - Microsoft\n\nMade with Unity 6000.3.8f1"
